BTW EXTRA CREDIT: special characters in a YARN (escape sequences :) :> :" ::)
HAI
  WAZZUP
    I HAS A greeting ITZ "Hello:)World"
    I HAS A row ITZ "name:>age:>grade"
  BUHBYE

  BTW :) is a newline inside a YARN
  VISIBLE greeting
  BTW :> is a tab inside a YARN
  VISIBLE "col1:>col2:>col3"
  BTW :" is a literal double-quote inside a YARN
  VISIBLE "He said :"goodbye:""
  BTW :: is a literal colon inside a YARN
  VISIBLE "ratio :: 1::2"
  BTW variable with tabs
  VISIBLE row
KTHXBYE

BTW EXPECTED OUTPUT:
BTW Hello
BTW World
BTW col1<TAB>col2<TAB>col3
BTW He said "goodbye"
BTW ratio : 1:2
BTW name<TAB>age<TAB>grade
